    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street gangster John Brown dared to cross paths with mafia boss Victor &quot;Fang&quot; Lorenzo. Instead of an immediate sentence, Lorenzo offers John a chance to prove his worth. Can he earn respect with his fists, or will his name be lost forever in the criminal chronicles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John Brown is a lone street thug for whom the law has always been just a meaningless word. Thus, he wasn't afraid to challenge Victor &quot;Fang&quot; Lorenzo\u2014a ruthless and influential mafia boss. For his audacity, John finds himself tied up in the luxurious hall of the mafia's residence, face to face with a man who decides fates with a snap of his fingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many stories would end at this point, but Lorenzo, recognizing John's exceptional combat skills, offers him an alternative path: if he can defeat all of the mafia's top fighters, he'll earn a chance to become part of the family; if not, he'll die like the rest. Can John take on numerous elite thugs alone, or is he destined to feed the worms in a grave? The outcome depends solely on you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724680/extras/908ee82175d051befc0cc5f30ea25732.avif?t=1751397895\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gangsters Way</i> delivers hardcore melee combat reminiscent of street brawls. You'll face numerous opponents alone, requiring you to utilize the full arsenal of a street fighter. Combine attacks into powerful chains, deftly dodge incoming strikes, and execute deadly special moves to take down enemies one by one. This isn't just a fight\u2014it's a fighter's journey, and if you want to see it through, you'll have to prove you're not just skilled... You're the best!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724680/extras/8ad9915b6907e33a3c4288d64ab6a7b5.avif?t=1751397895\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense third-person fighting with cinematic moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric crime story inspired by gangster action films</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of unique fighters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling one-on-one and group battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric soundtrack imbued with the spirit of the streets and gangster romance<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724680/extras/d11878ab6400813dc42dc31ca9888030.avif?t=1751397895\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p></li></ul>",
