src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724680/extras/8ad9915b6907e33a3c4288d64ab6a7b5.avif?t=1751397895\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense third-person fighting with cinematic moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric crime story inspired by gangster action films</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of unique fighters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling one-on-one and group battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric soundtrack imbued with the spirit of the streets and gangster romance<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724680/extras/d11878ab6400813dc42dc31ca9888030.avif?t=1751397895\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p></li></ul>",
